      "en": "The woman conceived; and she sent and told David, and said, “I am with child.”",
      "ko": "여인이 잉태하매 보내어 다윗에게 고하여 가로되 내가 잉태하였나이다 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "528aaf37348035202a7f18add32d8161d6523e7be5a39b3cbbdec89d9d16bba2",
      "translation_text_hash": "a4be81de72954c3de4b1b36c00cfdf5654f96836ad537900aca11736f6382594",
