        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 23
        }
      ],
      "en": "The messenger said to David, “The men prevailed against us, and came out to us into the field; and we were on them even to the entrance of the gate.",
      "ko": "가로되 그 사람들이 우리보다 승하여 우리를 향하여 들로 나온고로 우리가 저희를 쳐서 성문 어귀까지 미쳤더니",
      "source_text_hash": "836cd2b05cbd2d0ca2011e716c706355887d4f0183783ec32f7fdb7f511ad09c",
      "translation_text_hash": "d34de63d8d6dbf5bf1f60a5c62633eeb1e1df00a654e00078e78329eb318a082",
